          "description": "Maintain three planning artifacts with distinct scopes and storage: a Product Requirements Document (what to build, human-owned, committed to the repository), an Implementation Plan (all tasks with ordering and completion state, agent-owned, maintained as a GitHub Issue), and a Next Prompt (single next action, agent-owned, written as a local untracked file for session recovery). The PRD constrains the plan; the plan generates the next prompt. Information flows down; overrides flow up.\n",
